cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "DIO/ODI MCP: A Read-only Model Context Protocol Server for the DIO/ODI Reference Model and Agentic Entity Resolution Guardrail Mappings"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Beránek
    given-names: Daniel
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0050-0264"
version: 0.1.1
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24123229"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24123228"
    description: "Concept DOI for the software across versions"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dan-beranek/dio-odi-mcp"
abstract: >-
  Public, stateless, read-only Model Context Protocol server exposing a versioned
  DIO/ODI Reference Model snapshot and bounded Agentic Entity Resolution,
  reconstruction-failure, evidence-promotion, commit-boundary, and Policy-as-Code
  mappings. The service provides diagnostic and integration-reference data; it
  does not execute application authorization or mutate application state.
